/E (The system uses an optimized YOLOv3 model on edge devices to count vehicles at intersections in real time. It dynamically adjusts traffic light timings based on detected traffic density and communicates delays between junctions using low-power protocols IEEE 802.15.4 DSME and LoRaWAN.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [31]
>>
