/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 405 0 R
/E (The VaahanSetu platform successfully provides a real-time, efficient, and user-friendly solution for connecting customers with goods vehicle owners. By integrating smart matching, live tracking, and secure payment systems, the platform reduces delays, eliminates middlemen, and improves overall logistics efficiency.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
628 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 405 0 R
/E (In future, the system can be enhanced by adding advanced AI-based demand prediction, mobile app support, and multi-language features for wider accessibility. Further improvements may include route optimization, real-time traffic integration, and scaling the platform to support nationwide logistics operations.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
